        {
            "effetObjet": "",
            "effetPv": 0,
            "effetXp": 0,
            "html": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Une caverne beante s'ouvre devant vous, l'air sent le soufre. Votre torche crepite faiblement dans l'obscurite.</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Que decidez-vous ?</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page2.html#pv=-5\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">Entrer dans la caverne sombre</span></a></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page3.html\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">Contourner par la riviere</span></a></p></body></html>",
            "titre": "Le seuil de la caverne"
        },
        {
            "effetObjet": "",
            "effetPv": -5,
            "effetXp": 0,
            "html": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Des gobelins endormis ronflent autour d'un coffre. Dans un coin, une epee rouillee accroche la lueur de votre torche.</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page4.html#objet=Epee\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">Ramasser l'epee rouillee</span></a></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page5.html#pv=-10\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">Fuir en courant vers le tunnel</span></a></p></body></html>",
            "titre": "La salle aux gobelins"
        },
        {
            "effetObjet": "",
            "effetPv": 0,
            "effetXp": 5,
            "html": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Une eau noire murmure entre les rochers. En longeant la berge, vous apprenez a lire les traces des betes.</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page5.html#pv=-8\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">Traverser a la nage</span></a></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page4.html\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">Suivre la berge prudemment</span></a></p></body></html>",
            "titre": "La riviere souterraine"
        },
        {
            "effetObjet": "",
            "effetPv": 0,
            "effetXp": 0,
            "html": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Un vieux pont enjambe un gouffre sans fond. Au-dessus, une herse est retenue par une corde tendue.</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page6.html#requiert=Epee;xp=10\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">Trancher la corde d'un coup d'epee</span></a></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page6.html#pv=-5\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">Traverser prudemment sous la herse</span></a></p></body></html>",
            "titre": "Le pont de pierre"
        },
        {
            "effetObjet": "",
            "effetPv": -8,
            "effetXp": 0,
            "html": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Le sol se derobe sous vos pieds ! Vous tombez sur des pieux aceres et vous vous relevez en sang.</p></body></html>",
            "titre": "Le piege a pieux"
        },
        {
            "effetObjet": "",
            "effetPv": -5,
            "effetXp": 10,
            "html": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Un dragon ecarlate entrouvre un oeil de braise. Le combat parait inevitable.</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page7.html#requiert=Epee;xp=20\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">Brandir l'epee et frapper</span></a></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page8.html\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">L'attaquer a mains nues</span></a></p></body></html>",
            "titre": "L'antre du dragon"
        },
        {
            "effetObjet": "Epée",
            "effetPv": 0,
            "effetXp": 20,
            "html": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">D'un coup precis, vous terrassez le dragon dans un rugissement final. Le tresor de la caverne est a vous. Quelle aventure !</p></body></html>",
            "titre": "Victoire !"
        },
        {
            "effetObjet": "",
            "effetPv": 0,
            "effetXp": 0,
            "html": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Sans arme, vous ne faites pas le poids. Le souffle brulant du dragon a raison de vous. Votre quete s'acheve ici...</p></body></html>",
            "titre": "Defaite"
        }
    ]
